  "title": "Bermuda Cassava Pie",
  "description": "Cassava pie is a traditional Christmas dish served in Bermuda made with eggs, vanilla extract, nutmeg, and ginger in addition to the root also known as yucca.",
  "authors": [
    "sim871"
  ],
